# Evidence logs, patches, and observations preserve their original bytes.
*.log whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
*.patch whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
*.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
# The negative-control report uses Markdown's two-space hard line breaks.
REPORT.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol
